In Addition to the ownership of the Mladá fronta, Savov was involved in Harvestor Limited based in Cyprus, which dominated Samson Brewery in České Budějovice, and at Maraflex, a Cypriot company that is profiling itself as an investment fund buying endangered assets.
Heavy Machinery Services, formerly Legios, which owes more than three billion crowns.
In the past, Savov was also associated with seizing assets from the former Socialist Youth Confederation.
