La Liga May Regret Your Interest in Marco Verratti
Paris Saint-Germain won't allow Neymaro on his side in its quest to get Neymar on his side after she paid £189 million, i.e. the amount needed to buy Neymar out of his contract, but has the French team warned Barcelona of their record raigger three years ago?
