When Manchester City expressed interest in Blaise Matuidi in 2014, Nasser Al-Khelaifi has alerted every club that would be interested in recruiting one of PSG's best players.
"I'm terrified, because as soon as someone tries to get one of our players, then we'll certainly reach out to one of their players," Al-Khelaifi said.
“We respect all the clubs.
