Barcelona appears to have exceeded the imaginary line when they expressed interest in PSG midfielder Marc Verratti in the summer.
PSG has made it clear in the sense that under no circumstances will it allow the departure of an Italian representative. So it is possible that Barcelona is now swallowing a bitter pill during its presumptuous behavior with Neymaro's departure.
